            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai enerit teni Musa ebe, ‘Kitonyoikini yes Ejakait Edeke enabi kotoma oinacanakus loeputos keoŋ. Ŋol ŋes iirarete kotoma akiro kere nukilimokini yes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
