          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eebo, inabin kere ameun ka Samuel ka luketupakinete ŋes, kere lukineras, kelimonokinete nuka apaarasia kanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.24",
